    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "866760554": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1573861158,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Mind if I join you?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "133765117": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1573861158,
   "children": [
    1618086768
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Well, have fun.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1618086768": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 133765117,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Thanks.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Exit"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1165844837": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Sure, why not? Could use some company.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1340561613": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    2112696455,
    -1054122303,
    -1556252026
   ],
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Ugh...",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2112696455": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1340561613,
   "children": [
    315810732
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Rough day?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "315810732": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2112696455,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You could say that. Being a cop, trying to take down someone like Mario… it’s exhausting. But sometimes, it’s more than that. It’s…",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1054122303": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1340561613,
   "children": [
    -383698244,
    -131156359
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You look a bit lost.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-383698244": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1054122303,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You ever feel like you’re stuck between two worlds? For me, it’s like I’m constantly balancing between being a cop and just… being a woman. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1556252026": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1340561613,
   "children": [
    -530477414,
    80524407
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why did you become a cop in the first place?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-530477414": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1556252026,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I became a cop because I wanted to make a difference. Growing up, I saw so much injustice—things that shouldn’t happen to anyone. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1715862258": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -241826059,
    -477121127,
    -895969909
   ],
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well... At least the drinks here are pretty good.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-241826059": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1715862258,
   "children": [
    258938347,
    -448293431
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What do you hope for, after all of this is over?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "258938347": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -241826059,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I hope for peace, I guess. Maybe a chance to just… be me, without all the battles.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-477121127": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1715862258,
   "children": [
    -1769468933
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Do you ever wish you could leave it all behind?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1769468933": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -477121127,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Sometimes. But I’m not sure who I’d be without it. It’s hard to imagine a life where I’m not fighting for something. But maybe… maybe one day, I’ll find out.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-895969909": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1715862258,
   "children": [
    -1108624455
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What’s the hardest part of your job?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1108624455": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -895969909,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "t’s the loneliness, I think. The constant pressure to be strong, to never show weakness. You lose touch with people, with yourself. It wears on you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2723595": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I didn’t expect to get so deep tonight, but… it’s nice to talk about this with someone who gets it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1688902229": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Thanks, {PC}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-448293431": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -241826059,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "A life where I’m not constantly fighting, where I can finally let my guard down.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "80524407": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1556252026,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "I thought if I could change even a little part of the world, it would be worth it. But now… sometimes it feels like the job is changing me instead.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-131156359": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1054122303,
   "actor": "Sofia",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’ve had to be tough, to be relentless, but sometimes I wonder if I’ve lost touch with who I am outside the badge.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
